            <html:p><fr:link href="/dhsorens-msc/" title="MSc in Algebraic Topology" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-msc/" display-uri="dhsorens-msc" type="local">MSc</fr:link> in Mathematics and Foundations of Computer Science (MFoCS) at the <fr:link href="/dhsorens-oxf/" title="University of Oxford" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-oxf/" display-uri="dhsorens-oxf" type="local">University of Oxford</fr:link>. <fr:link href="/dhsorens-phd/" title="PhD in Formal Methods" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-phd/" display-uri="dhsorens-phd" type="local">PhD</fr:link> in formal methods at the <fr:link href="/dhsorens-cam/" title="University of Cambridge" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/dhsorens-cam/" display-uri="dhsorens-cam" type="local">University of Cambridge</fr:link> under <fr:link href="/avsm/" title="Anil Madhavapeddy" uri="https://derekhsorensen.com/avsm/" display-uri="avsm" type="local">Anil Madhavapeddy</fr:link>.
</html:p>
